      "audio_file": "scenes/scene_01.wav",
      "narration": "Three hundred fifty kilometers per hour. A Shinkansen enters a tunnel, and the air ahead has nowhere to go. It compresses into a moving wall, then fires out of the far portal like a cannon. Four hundred meters away, windows rattle. Engineers call it tunnel boom. The fix was not a bigger engine. It was a bird.",
