    {
      "id": "scene-06",
      "number": 6,
      "start": 100.45,
      "duration": 15.075,
      "audio_file": "scenes/scene_06.wav",
      "narration": "Piston. No escape. Air becomes a ram. Pressure climbs. Five kilopascals. Enough to flex steel. Enough to shake concrete. The train keeps pushing. The tunnel is now a pressure vessel. But the real explosion waits at the exit.",
