      "number": 18,
      "start": 342.36,
      "duration": 16.625,
      "audio_file": "scenes/scene_18.wav",
      "narration": "Longer nose. Less boom. Wrong shape. More shake. The wind tunnel kept saying no. At three hundred fifty kilometers per hour, the pressure pulse was still too strong. A blunt face hammered the air. A needle face wandered in crosswinds. Then an engineer looked at a bird.",
