      "number": 21,
      "start": 405.36,
      "duration": 23.3,
      "audio_file": "scenes/scene_21.wav",
      "narration": "The result was the five hundred series Shinkansen. Its long nose did more than look strange. It cut energy use by about fifteen percent and raised speed by about ten. It also made the train quieter. In service it ran at three hundred kilometers per hour, with a design speed of three hundred twenty. The next generation was already aiming higher. The shape was doing work no motor could do.",
